<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Progressive cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Progressive cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- C.S. First Boston confirmed that it cut Progressive Corp's rating to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares of the insurance company slipped 1/4 to 57.</p>
</text>
